  "releaseNotes": "Add callback-based HTTP(S) client helpers\n\n      - HttpClient and HttpsClient now expose response/header/error callback properties and wire them into the existing response handlers.\n      - The change also adds static async-style helper methods for sending HEAD/GET/POST/PUT/DELETE/OPTIONS/TRACE requests with per-call response and error callbacks, including automatic disconnect after response handling.",
